**依据 3 · 源码核查**：[src/upstream.ts:3343-3374](https://github.com/dingminhua/dsh-connect-workbuddy/blob/bba5ea5c638995f612dfbb4612951a0a4e3532ac/src/upstream.ts#L3343-L3374)

